[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0168","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1889","title":"Microsoft XML Core Services 未初始化内存远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft XML Core Services（MSXML）3.0、4.0、5.0 和 6.0 版本中存在未初始化内存访问漏洞。当 MSXML 解析特制 XML 内容时，由于未正确初始化内存对象，攻击者可通过构造恶意网站诱导用户访问，触发内存破坏，从而实现远程代码执行或拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如点击链接或浏览网页），CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 MS12-043 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1889"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-06-13T04:46:46.190","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:29.923","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS12-043 提供的更新，该更新修复了 MSXML 3.0/4.0/5.0/6.0 中的未初始化内存访问漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新，或手动下载 KB2721691（MSXML 3.0）、KB2721693（MSXML 4.0）、KB2721692（MSXML 5.0）、KB2721694（MSXML 6.0）对应版本补丁。临时缓解措施：将 Internet 安全区域设置为高以禁用 ActiveX 控件，或配置 IE 在运行 ActiveX 控件前提示。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2719615","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-174A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-192A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-043","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15195","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1889","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19186","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-1889.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2012/CVE-2012-1889.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1889","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2012/CVE-2012-1889.rules","https://github.com/buffer/thug/blob/c6776b2b9d44228772c76cc8b82218a395c764ad/thug/ActiveX/modules/MSXML2DOMDocument.py","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/706c16a4787d37bf8dcd30da5df424ea091c303e/2012/README.md","https://github.com/sergey-pronin/OSCP_Source/blob/c3121bae586e23bce13e16a4091302d298833df2/Exploit_Code/CVE-2012-1889.py","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-1889/README_KO.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-1889.txt","https://github.com/whu-enjoy/CVE-2012-1889","https://github.com/l-iberty/cve-2012-1889"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0168.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0168.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0198","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2034","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的网页或打开恶意文件触发内存损坏，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows/Mac OS X 平台 10.3.183.20 之前及 11.x 11.3.300.257 之前版本、Linux 平台 10.3.183.20 之前及 11.x 11.2.202.236 之前版本、Android 2.x/3.x 平台 11.1.111.10 之前版本、Android 4.x 平台 11.1.115.9 之前版本，以及 Adobe AIR 3.3.0.3610 之前版本。攻击者利用此漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（如点击链接或打开文件），CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复该漏洞，该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2034"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-06-09T00:55:00.987","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:50.083","remediation":"升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 Windows/Mac 版 11.3.300.257 或 10.3.183.20 以上、Linux 版 11.2.202.236 或 10.3.183.20 以上、Android 版 11.1.115.9 以上，并将 Adobe AIR 升级至 3.3.0.3610 以上。鉴于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 方案以根除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-06/msg00007.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0722.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-14.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-2034","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-2034.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2012/2xxx/CVE-2012-2034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2034","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-2034.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-2034.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/SSVC/data/2012/CVE-2012-2034.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-2034","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-2034.csv","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2012-2034.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0066","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0507","title":"Oracle Java SE AtomicReferenceArray 类型违规远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE i18n子组件中AtomicReferenceArray类实现存在类型违规漏洞，未验证数组是否为Object[]类型，导致远程攻击者可通过构造恶意Java应用程序或Applet，利用类型混淆绕过Java沙箱安全限制，实现沙箱逃逸并执行任意代码，或导致JVM崩溃造成拒绝服务。影响Oracle Java SE 7 Update 2及更早版本、6 Update 30及更早版本、5.0 Update 33及更早版本。攻击者无需身份认证，通过网络诱导用户访问包含恶意Java Applet的网页即可触发，无需用户交互，CVSS 3.1评分9.8（CRITICAL），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、无需用户交互、影响机密性/完整性/可用性均为高。该漏洞已被纳入CISA已知被利用漏洞目录，Metasploit框架集成了AtomicReferenceArray Type Violation利用模块（ExploitDB编号18679），攻击者可构造恶意Applet绕过安全管理器直接执行系统命令。Oracle已在2012年2月CPU补丁中修复该漏洞，建议升级至Java SE 7 Update 3、6 Update 31或5.0 Update 34及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0507"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-06-07T22:55:17.883","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:26.540","remediation":"安装 Oracle Java SE 7 Update 4 或更高版本、Java SE 6 Update 32 或更高版本、或 Java SE 5.0 Update 34 或更高版本，并确保启动时禁用不安全的 i18n 子组件，同时在 Java Control Panel 中启用自动安全更新并使用最新的安全策略设置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.technet.com/b/mmpc/archive/2012/03/20/an-interesting-case-of-jre-sandbox-breach-cve-2012-0507.aspx","http://krebsonsecurity.com/2012/03/new-java-attack-rolled-into-exploit-packs/","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00009.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00010.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133364885411663&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133365109612558&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133847939902305&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134254866602253&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134254957702612&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0508.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0514.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-1455.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48589","http://secunia.com/advisories/48692","http://secunia.com/advisories/48915","http://secunia.com/advisories/48948","http://secunia.com/advisories/48950","http://weblog.ikvm.net/PermaLink.aspx?guid=cd48169a-9405-4f63-9087-798c4a1866d3","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2420","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/javacpufeb2012-366318.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52161","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=788994","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-0507","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18679","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-0507.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/0b3544b982e9e72f18783404822d75ab7ead4564/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Java/Exploit/CVE-2012-0507.yara","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0507.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/WinNT/CVE-2012-0507/Exploit_WinNT_CVE-2012-0507_S.yar","https://github.com/LyleMi/Learn-Web-Hacking/blob/7a42e3252fdcae87663434b1fd54ec89d671bfbe/source/language/java/sandbox.rst","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0507","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-0507/README.md","https://github.com/killvxk/thg-framework/blob/fab929cd77c91373ebc4212bd4e5891b54f0fb1b/data/source/exploits/CVE-2012-0507/Makefile","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/17884.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-0507.txt","https://github.com/frg316/cve2012-0507"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0066.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0066.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0011","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1823","title":"PHP PHP-CGI 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PHP 以 CGI 模式运行时，其 sapi/cgi/cgi_main.c 组件未能正确处理不含等号（=）的查询字符串，导致远程攻击者可通过在 URL 查询字符串中注入 PHP 命令行选项（如 -d 指定配置指令）实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 PHP 5.3.12 以下版本及 5.4.2 以下版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，危害等级严重。官方已在 PHP 5.3.12 和 5.4.2 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1823"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-05-11T10:15:48.043","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:22.147","remediation":"立即将 PHP 升级至 5.3.12 或 5.4.2 及以上版本。如无法升级，将 PHP 运行模式从 CGI 切换为 FastCGI 或 mod_php，或在 Web 服务器层面配置 RewriteRule 拒绝包含 `-d`、`-s` 等命令行参数的 CGI 请求。同时限制 php-cgi 对外部输入的直接访问，避免将用户可控参数传递给 PHP 解释器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://eindbazen.net/2012/05/php-cgi-advisory-cve-2012-1823/","http://h20000.www2.hp.com/bizsupport/TechSupport/Document.jsp?objectID=c03360041","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00002.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00007.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-05/msg00011.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134012830914727&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0546.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0547.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0568.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0569.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0570.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49014","http://secunia.com/advisories/49065","http://secunia.com/advisories/49085","http://secunia.com/advisories/49087","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5501","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2465","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/520827","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/673343","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:068","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/06/07/1","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php#5.4.2","http://www.php.net/archive/2012.php#id2012-05-03-1","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027022","https://bu