.com/cyberharsh/PHP_CVE-2012-1823"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0106","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1710","title":"Oracle Fusion Middleware WebCenter Forms Recognition 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 10.1.3.5 中的 Oracle WebCenter Forms Recognition 组件存在未指定安全漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络利用未知向量攻击该组件，导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互，影响范围广泛。Oracle 已在 2012 年关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1710"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-05-03T22:55:02.967","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:08.810","remediation":"立即登录 My Oracle Support 下载并安装 Oracle Fusion Middleware 10.1.3.5 的 April 2012 Critical Patch Update（CPUApr2012，参考 My Oracle Support Note 1406574.1）。如无法立即打补丁，建议在 Web 应用防火墙或网络层面限制对 WebCenter Forms Recognition Designer 组件的 HTTP 访问，仅允许受信 IP 来源访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:150","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuapr2012-366314.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026949","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1710","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-1710.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1710.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1710","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1710.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-1710.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-1710/poc.py","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-1710.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-1710.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-ch5p-j98f-3rg5/GHSA-ch5p-j98f-3rg5.json","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/df98cd885e49b66ef39b05ac11ddad1b492edabf/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0044","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0158","title":"Microsoft Office MSCOMCTL ActiveX 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 等产品中 MSCOMCTL.OCX 控件（Common Controls）的 ListView、TreeView 等 ActiveX 控件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的 Office 文档、RTF 文件或访问恶意网页触发该漏洞，导致内存损坏，从而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Office 2003/2007/2010、SQL Server 2000/2005/2008、Visual Basic 6.0 等多个产品，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。2012 年 4 月已被在野利用，微软在 MS12-027 安全公告中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0158"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-04-10T21:55:01.687","updated":"2026-06-16T23:36:48.343","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS12-027 对应更新：Office 2003 安装 KB2597112，Office 2007 安装 KB2597113，Office 2010 安装 KB2597114，SQL Server 安装对应版本补丁。临时缓解措施：在注册表中为 MSCOMCTL.OCX 控件设置 Kill Bit（CLSID: {BDD1F04B-858B-11D1-B16A-00C0F0283628}），阻止 ActiveX 在 IE 中运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://opensources.info/comment-on-the-curious-case-of-a-cve-2012-0158-exploit-by-chris-pierce/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52911","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026899","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026900","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026902","http://www.se