58-reproduction","https://github.com/RobertoLeonFR-ES/Exploit-Win32.CVE-2012-0158.F.doc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0044.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0044.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0033","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0033.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0151","title":"Microsoft Windows Authenticode签名验证远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 的 Authenticode 代码签名验证功能（WinVerifyTrust）存在签名校验绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于系统在对已签名的可移植可执行文件（PE）进行摘要验证时，未能正确校验数字签名的完整性，导致攻击者可在不破坏原有签名的情况下向合法签名的 PE 文件中添加恶意载荷。攻击者需要诱使用户打开特制的恶意文件（如通过钓鱼邮件或恶意网站），即可在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows XP SP2/SP3、Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 Gold/SP1 及 Windows 8 Consumer Preview 等多个版本，已被 CISA KEV 收录，表明已存在在野利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0151"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-04-10T21:55:01.597","updated":"2026-06-16T23:36:47.550","remediation":"立即安装微软 2012 年 4 月安全更新 MS12-024 (KB2653956)，该补丁修复了 WinVerifyTrust 签名验证函数对 PE 文件摘要校验不充分的问题。Windows 7 及更早系统可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新；Windows XP SP3 用户需手动下载 KB2653956 安装。对于无法打补丁的旧系统，建议限制用户仅从可信来源运行可执行文件，并部署应用程序白名单策略（如 AppLocker）阻止未签名或篡改的 PE 文件执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/81135","http://secunia.com/advisories/48581","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026906","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-101A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-024","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15594","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-0151","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-0151.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0151.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0151","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0151.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-0151.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-0151.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-0151.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-0151.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-99qx-cj76-9w2h/GHSA-99qx-cj76-9w2h.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0007","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0996","title":"11in1 CMS 目录遍历漏洞","description":"11in1 CMS 1.2.1 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 或 admin/index.php 的 class 参数传入 `../` 等路径遍历序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的 class 参数进行充分的路径过滤与校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0996"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-02-24T13:55:02.733","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:38.130","remediation":"11in1 1.2.1 及之前版本受影响，建议升级至官方最新版本；如已停止维护，需在 index.php 和 admin/index.php 中对 class 参数使用 basename() 或正则过滤移除 ../ 路径遍历序列，仅允许字母数字字符；或通过 WAF 规则拦截包含 ../ 的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references"