证。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1226"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-02-21T13:31:47.830","updated":"2026-06-16T23:39:17.287","remediation":"立即升级至 Dolibarr 3.2.0 以上稳定版本，官方已在 commit 5381986 和 8f9b998 中修复：对 GETPOST 参数增加 alpha/int 类型校验，并在 functions.lib.php 中过滤 `../` 路径穿越字符。如无法升级，可在 document.php 和 comm/action/fiche.php 中对 file 和 backtopage 参数增加 `preg_match('/(\\.\\.\\/)+/', $val)` 拦截检查作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2012-02/0168.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18480","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/521583","http://www.vulnerability-lab.com/get_content.php?id=428","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/73136","https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/commit/5381986e50dd6055f2b3b63281eaacffa0449da2","https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr/commit/8f9b9987ffb42cfbe907fe31ded3001bfc1b3417","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18480","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-1226.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-1226.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-1226.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-1226.js","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2012-1226-2159.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2012-1226-2162.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/1fbe10ab16286f76d48d05cc69bf8f87022ac5c8/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-1226.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Apr/02/Reports/Report.csv","https://github.com/0neOfU4/dddd/blob/9d41a5bbdbd3