","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0754"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-02-16T19:55:01.130","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:11.620","remediation":"升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.15 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris），或 11.1.102.62 及以上版本（11.x 系列）；Android 2.x/3.x 升级至 11.1.111.6 及以上，Android 4.x 升级至 11.1.115.6 及以上。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持并停止发布安全更新，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并禁用浏览器中的 Flash 插件，改用 HTML5 替代方案以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00014.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0144.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48265","http://secunia.com/advisories/48819","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-07.xml","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-03.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15030","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15973","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-0754","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18572","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-0754.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0754.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0754","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-0754.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-0754.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617