":["CVE-2012-0981"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-02-02T17:55:01.677","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:36.367","remediation":"phpShowtime 2.0 已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议立即停用 phpShowtime，迁移至仍在维护的图片展示系统。如无法替换，需手动修改 index.php 对 r 参数做路径过滤，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历序列，并使用 realpath() 将解析路径限制在网站根目录内，同时在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）层面禁止访问非公开目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/47802","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18435","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/72824","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18435","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0981.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-0981.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0981.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0981.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2012/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0981.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/03/Artifact/Report.csv","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-0981-2146.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2012-0981.yaml","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/9238de8f3cf6aee095a9c59813ce1d5bb6ba2585/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0981.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0003","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0896","title":"WordPress Count Per Day 插件绝对路径遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress Count Per Day 插件（版本 3.1.1 之前）的 download.php 文件中存在绝对路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 f 参数传递包含 ../ 等路径遍历序列的特制请求，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危，影响所有使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0896"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-01-20T17:55:01.910","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:27.953","remediation":"立即将 Count Per Day 插件升级至 3.1.1 及以上版本。由于该插件已于 2019 年因违规被关闭下架且不再维护，建议彻底停用并删除此插件，改用其他受支持的访客统计插件（如 Jetpack Stats 或 Site Kit by Google）。如无法立即删除，可在 .htaccess 中添加 `<Files \"download.php\"> Order Allow,Deny Deny from all </Files>` 阻断对该文件的直接访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/78270","http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/108631/countperday-downloadxss.txt","http://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/488883/count-per-day","http://secunia.com/advisories/47529","http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/count-per-day/changelog/","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18355","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/51402","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/72385","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18355","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0896.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-0896.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0896.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-0896.js","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2012-0896-2132.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2012-0896-2134.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-0896_1.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0896.json","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2012-0896-2132.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/04/traversalArtifact/traversalReport.csv","https://github.com/TenrootOrg/risx-mssp-python/blob/4f1caa79453160d0e6d423fd174e42ff9b1204fb/modules/Nuclei/dependencies/Windows/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-0896.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0004","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0901","title":"WordPress YouSayToo auto-publishing 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 YouSayToo auto-publishing 插件 1.0 版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 yousaytoo.php 文件的 submit 参数。远程攻击者可通过向该参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响的页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 YouSayToo auto-publishing 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。建议升级插件或对用户输入进行严格过滤。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0901"],"sources":["cve","nuclei"],"published":"2012-01-20","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"YouSayToo auto-publishing 插件自 2012 年起已停止维护，厂商未发布安全补丁。建议立即停用并删除该插件，替换为其他活跃维护的 WordPress 自动发布插件。如无法替换，需在服务器端对 yousaytoo.php 的 submit 参数进行严格的输入过滤和输出编码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T11:04:15.479252162+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0004.toml"}]